      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    annual_returns = [0.09, 0.05, 0.08]\n    embedded_gain_pct = 0.10\n    capital_gains_tax_rate = 0.25\n    periods = 3\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    compounded_growth = 1\n    for rate in annual_returns:\n        compounded_growth *= 1 + rate\n\n    liquidation_tax_pct = embedded_gain_pct * capital_gains_tax_rate\n    post_liquidation_growth = compounded_growth * (1 - liquidation_tax_pct)\n    annualized_return_pct = (post_liquidation_growth ** (1 / periods) - 1) * 100\n\n    # Return the answer to three decimal places\n    return round(annualized_return_pct, 3)\n```",
